<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15189" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρκτέον</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
				(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρχομαι</span>) <i>one must begin,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι πρᾶγμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					853
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάλιν ἀ. ἀπ᾽ ἀρχῆς</span>
			<i>one must make a</i> fresh <i>start,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				48b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τοῦ πρώτου, τῶν πρώτων,
				τῶν γνωρίμων ἀ.,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1013a3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GA</u>
				737b25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EN</u>
				1095b2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				15.1.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρχω</span>) <i>one must govern,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					14.10
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				628
			</span></i>, al. (<i>you must be ruled,</i> i.e.
		<i>obey</i>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
